Start a scan against a target using the named profile

Usage:
  usulnet recon scan start <target-id> [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help             help for start
      --profile string   profile name or UUID (required)
      --watch            stream scan events to stdout

Global Flags:
  -c, --config string   config file path (default: /etc/usulnet/config.yaml or ./config.yaml)
      --output string   output format: table|json|yaml (default "table")
      --server string   usulnet API URL (default $USULNET_API_URL)
      --token string    API token (default $USULNET_API_TOKEN)
